## SAFE DEFAULTS STRATEGY (MANDATORY)

| Field Type | Strategy | Example |
|------------|----------|---------|
| Display fields | Natural null | `customer.name` |
| Arithmetic | `default 0` | `price as Number default 0` |
| Date arithmetic | `default now()` | `orderDate as Date default now()` |
| Boolean logic | `default false` | `isActive as Boolean default false` |

> **Details**: See `@03-01-01_Guidance.mdc`

